description: Non-negotiable repository rules for all work in this Chrome extension monorepo.
alwaysApply: true
---

Read and follow @AGENTS.md before making meaningful changes.

Repository-wide references:
- @docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
- @docs/SECURITY.md
- @docs/QA.md
- @docs/STORE_POLICY.md
- @docs/DEVELOPMENT.md
- @docs/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md
- @docs/CURSOR.md

Mandatory behavior:
- Preserve the multi-extension monorepo boundary: products live under `apps/<slug>`.
- Chrome Manifest V3, TypeScript, WXT, pnpm, Vitest, and Playwright are the repository defaults.
- Do not broaden permissions, data collection, external transmission, or product scope without documenting it first.
- Never add remote executable code, `eval`, `new Function`, secrets, or session material.
- Treat background service workers as ephemeral and third-party page content as untrusted.
- Keep unrelated extensions unchanged.
- Use the shared design system for extension-owned UI.
- Run `pnpm verify:repo` and all relevant QA gates before declaring implementation complete.
- If repository rules conflict with an app-local convenience, repository rules win unless the app SPEC explicitly records an approved exception.
